abla = pd.read_csv(archivo, dtype={\"registro\": str, \"paciente\": str})\n","print(f\"{len(tabla)} ventanas · medidas: {MEDIDAS}\")\n","display(pd.crosstab(tabla.base, tabla.etiqueta, margins=True, margins_name=\"Total\"))"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"5addbd22","metadata":{"papermill":{"duration":0.002761,"end_time":"2026-11-25T21:55:13.881796+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-11-25T21:55:13.879035+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"source":["## 1. Decisiones de la división"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":3,"id":"d9b454fb","metadata":{"execution":{"iopub.execute_input":"2026-11-25T21:55:13.889419Z","iopub.status.busy":"2026-11-25T21:55:13.889061Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-11-25T21:55:13.893746Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-11-25T21:55:13.892848Z"},"papermill":{"duration":0.01055,"end_time":"2026-11-25T21:55:13.895616+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-11-25T21:55:13.885066+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"outputs":[],"source":["SEMILLA = 42                      # misma semilla = misma división siempre (reproducible)\n","PROPORCIONES = (0.70, 0.15, 0.15) # entrenamiento, validación, prueba"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"2083fa43","metadata":{"papermill":{"duration":0.002758,"end_time":"2026-11-25T21:55:13.90132+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-11-25T21:55:13.898562+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"source":["---\n","## 2. MIT-BIH AF: dividir **por paciente**\n","Se reparten **pacientes completos**: todas las ventanas de un paciente van al mismo conjunto. Además se pide que cada conjunto tenga al menos un paciente con FA y uno con ritmo normal; si el sorteo no lo cumple, se vuelve a sortear (con la misma semilla, el resultado siempre es el mismo)."]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":4,"id":"7b192e18","metadata":{"execution":{"iopub.execute_input":"2026-11-25T21:55:13.908514Z","iopub.status.busy":"2026-11-25T21:55:13.908157Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-11-25T21:55:13.936343Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-11-25T21:55:13.9354Z"},"papermill":{"duration":0.03432,"end_time":"2026-11-25T21:55:13.938401+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-11-25T21:55:13.904081+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"outputs":[{"name":"stdout","output_type":"stream","text":["Sorteo aceptado en el intento 1\n","  prueba        :  3 pacientes → 06426, 08215, 08219\n","  validacion    :  3 pacientes → 07879, 07910, 08455\n","  entrenamiento : 17 pacientes → 04015, 04043, 04048, 04126, 04746, 04908, 04936, 05091, 05121, 05261, 06453, 06995, 07162, 07859, 08378, 08405, 08434\n"]}],"source":["afdb = tabla[tabla.base == \"MIT-BIH AF\"]\n","pacientes = np.array(sorted(afdb.paciente.unique()))\n","con_fa = set(afdb[afdb.etiqueta == \"A\"].paciente)\n","con_n = set(afdb[afdb.etiqueta == \"N\"].paciente)\n","\n","n_val = max(1, round(len(pacientes) * PROPORCIONES[1]))\n","n_pru = max(1, round(len(pacientes) * PROPORCIONES[2]))\n","rng = np.random.default_rng(SEMILLA)\n","for intento in range(1, 1001):\n","    orden = rng.permutation(pacientes)\n","    grupos = {\"prueba\": set(orden[:n_pru]), \"validacion\": set(orden[n_pru:n_pru + n_val]),\n","              \"entrenamiento\": set(orden[n_pru + n_val:])}\n","    if all(g & con_fa and g & con_n for g in grupos.values()):\n","        break\n","print(f\"Sorteo aceptado en el intento {intento}\")\n","for nombre, g in grupos.items():\n","    print(f\"  {nombre:14s}: {len(g):2d} pacientes → {', '.join(sorted(str(x) for x in g))}\")\n","conjunto_afdb = {p: nombre for nombre, g in grupos.items() for p in g}"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"6bc6c810","metadata":{"papermill":{"duration":0.002796,"end_time":"2026-11-25T21:55:13.944171+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-11-25T21:55:13.941375+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"source":["## 3. CinC 2017: dividir **estratificado** por registro\n","\n","CinC **no dice de qué paciente es cada registro**, así que no se puede separar por paciente. Se reparten los **registros**, pero de forma **estratificada**: cada conjunto queda con la misma proporción de N, A, O y ~. Si no, por azar, la prueba podría quedarse casi sin FA.\n","\n","Se hace en dos cortes: primero 70 % / 30 %, y luego ese 30 % se parte a la mitad (15 % / 15 %)."]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":5,"id":"1419f876","metadata":{"execution":{"iopub.execute_input":"2026-11-25T21:55:13.951342Z","iopub.status.busy":"2026-11-25T21:55:13.950996Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-11-25T21:55:14.000659Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-11-25T21:55:13.99984Z"},"papermill":{"duration":0.055505,"end_time":"2026-11-25T21:55:14.002422+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-11-25T21:55:13.946917+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"outputs":[{"name":"stdout","output_type":"stream","text":["Ventanas sin conjunto asignado: 0\n"]}],"source":["cinc = tabla[tabla.base == \"CinC2017\"]\n","entrena_c, resto_c = train_test_split(cinc.registro, test_size=PROPORCIONES[1] + PROPORCIONES[2],\n","                                      stratify=cinc.etiqueta, random_state=SEMILLA)\n","val_c, pru_c = train_test_split(resto_c, test_size=PROPORCIONES[2] / (PROPORCIONES[1] + PROPORCIONES[2]),\n","                                stratify=cinc.set_index(\"registro\").loc[resto_c, \"etiqueta\"], random_state=SEMILLA)\n","conjunto_cinc = {**{r: \"entrenamiento\" for r in entrena_c}, **{r: \"validacion\" for r in val_c},\n","                 **{r: \"prueba\" for r in pru_c}}\n","\n","tabla[\"conjunto\"] = np.where(tabla.base == \"MIT-BIH AF\", tabla.paciente.map(conjunto_afdb),\n","                             tabla.registro.map(conjunto_cinc))\n","print(\"Ventanas sin conjunto asignado:\", tabla.conjunto.isna().sum())"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"d68cfc58","metadata":{"papermill":{"duration":0.002958,"end_time":"2026-11-25T21:55:14.008462+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-11-25T21:55:14.005504+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"source":["---\n","## 4. Comprobaciones: ¿hay fuga? ¿quedó bien repartido?\n","\n","### 4.1 Ningún paciente ni registro en dos conjuntos"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":6,"id":"360d4ae1","metadata":{"execution":{"iopub.execute_input":"2026-11-25T21:55:14.016581Z","iopub.status.busy":"2026-11-25T21:55:14.016046Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-11-25T21:55:14.055852Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-11-25T21:55:14.054844Z"},"papermill":{"duration":0.046084,"end_time":"2026-11-25T21:55:14.057676+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-11-25T21:55:14.011592+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"outputs":[{"name":"stdout","output_type":"stream","text":["Pacientes en más de un conjunto: 0\n","Registros en más de un conjunto: 0\n","✓ Sin fuga por paciente ni por registro\n"]}],"source":["def en_varios(columna):\n","    cuantos = tabla.groupby([\"base\", columna]).conjunto.nunique()\n","    return cuantos[cuantos > 1]\n","\n","repetidos_pac = en_varios(\"paciente\")\n","repetidos_reg = en_varios(\"registro\")\n","print(\"Pacientes en más de un conjunto:\", len(repetidos_pac))\n","print(\"Registros en más de un conjunto:\", len(repetidos_reg))\n","assert len(repetidos_pac) == 0 and len(repetidos_reg) == 0, \"¡Hay fuga! Revisa la división\"\n","print(\"✓ Sin fuga por paciente ni por registro\")"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"4d5f60d5","metadata":{"papermill":{"duration":0.002996,"end_time":"2026-11-25T21:55:14.063739+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-11-25T21:55:14.060743+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"source":["### 4.2 ¿Cuántas ventanas y qué proporción de clases quedó en cada conjunto?"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":7,"id":"068a06db","metadata":{"execution":{"iopub.execute_input":"2026-11-25T21:55:14.07109Z","iopub.status.busy":"2026-11-25T21:55:14.070753Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-11-25T21:55:14.466576Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-11-25T21:55:14.465643Z"},"papermill":{"duration":0.40188,"end_time":"2026-11-25T21:55:14.468512+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-11-25T21:55:14.066632+00:00","status":